<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>塔羅入門系列 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97/</link><description>Recent content in 塔羅入門系列 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>三張牌牌陣教學：過去、現在、未來之外還能怎麼排？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E7%89%8C%E9%99%A3%E6%95%99%E5%AD%B8%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%82%84%E8%83%BD%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E6%8E%92/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E7%89%8C%E9%99%A3%E6%95%99%E5%AD%B8%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%82%84%E8%83%BD%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E6%8E%92/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;朋友說：「我明天要跟主管談加薪，幫我抽過去、現在、未來。」我會先停一下。過去發生過什麼，主管多半也知道；明天真正需要的是知道&lt;strong&gt;現況、卡點，以及談話策略&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>小牌數字 1 到 10 怎麼記？從開始到完成的解牌線索</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%8F%E7%89%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%971%E5%88%B010%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A8%98%E5%BE%9E%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%8F%E7%89%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%971%E5%88%B010%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A8%98%E5%BE%9E%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;翻到聖杯七，記一個意思；翻到寶劍七，又是另一個。這時如果有人說「先把 40 張數字牌背完」，我大概會先把牌收起來。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>抽到死神、高塔、惡魔怎麼辦？三張難牌的真實訊息</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%BB%E7%A5%9E%E9%AB%98%E5%A1%94%E6%83%A1%E9%AD%94%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%BE%A6%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E9%9B%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%BB%E7%A5%9E%E9%AB%98%E5%A1%94%E6%83%A1%E9%AD%94%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%BE%A6%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E9%9B%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果朋友幫你抽牌，翻出一張死神，卻在你開口之前先皺眉說「這不太妙」，整場解讀大概已經歪掉一半。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>抽塔羅前怎麼問問題？從每日一張牌開始練習</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%89%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%95%8F%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%BE%9E%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%89%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%95%8F%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%BE%9E%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;手機放在桌上，訊息已讀了兩小時。你拿起牌，腦中只有一句：「他到底愛不愛我？」這個問題我懂，但抽完牌之後，你可能還是只能繼續盯著手機。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅宮廷牌怎麼解？侍者、騎士、皇后、國王</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E7%89%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A7%A3%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%8E%8B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E7%89%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A7%A3%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%8E%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;抽到聖杯皇后，很多人會開始在腦中點名：「媽媽？伴侶？上週安慰我的朋友？」翻牌才三秒，身邊的人已經被你排查一輪。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅逆位一定不好嗎？四種讀法與判斷順序</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E9%80%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E5%97%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A8%AE%E8%AE%80%E6%B3%95%E8%88%87%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B7%E9%A0%86%E5%BA%8F/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E9%80%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E5%97%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A8%AE%E8%AE%80%E6%B3%95%E8%88%87%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B7%E9%A0%86%E5%BA%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;太陽牌翻出來，本來應該鬆一口氣；偏偏它是倒著的。於是剛剛那口氣又吸回去：「太陽逆位，是不是連好牌都變壞了？」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅牌新手入門：78 張牌到底怎麼分？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%85%A5%E9%96%8078%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%88%86/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%85%A5%E9%96%8078%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%88%86/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;一副新塔羅牌拆封後，最有壓力的可能不是抽到什麼牌，而是那疊厚得像考試範圍的牌卡：&lt;strong&gt;78 張，難道要全部背起來？&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅解牌完整示範：面對兩個選擇，怎麼從牌走到行動？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%BE%9E%E7%89%8C%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%B0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%BE%9E%E7%89%8C%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%B0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;星期五下午，一封新公司的錄取通知寄來。你開心了五分鐘，接著開始算通勤、薪資、試用期，還有現在團隊那幾個真正合作得來的人。留下，還是走？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>愚者之旅是什麼？用一條故事線讀懂 22 張大牌</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%84%9A%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E7%B7%9A%E8%AE%80%E6%87%8222%E5%BC%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%8C/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%84%9A%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E7%B7%9A%E8%AE%80%E6%87%8222%E5%BC%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%8C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;假設你帶著一只小包袱出門，沒有導航，也不知道沿途會遇到誰。這是愚者牌的開場。走到旅程終點時，你已經不是出發時的你。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>權杖、聖杯、寶劍、錢幣：四牌組怎麼看？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%AC%8A%E6%9D%96%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E5%9B%9B%E7%89%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%AC%8A%E6%9D%96%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E5%9B%9B%E7%89%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同事開會時說「這案子我們一定要做！」，你心裡卻想：「大家講得很熱血，預算到底在哪？」同一場會議，前一句很權杖，後一句很錢幣。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>